{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1677","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1677","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1677\",\"parent_revision\":\"25b05b3a9acd1b184443874d965da874a463e0b4d9e9d1f1bb94bd3b2901edd5\",\"root_revision\":\"25b05b3a9acd1b184443874d965da874a463e0b4d9e9d1f1bb94bd3b2901edd5\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nA `PreCompact` hook (`.claude/hooks/pre-compact-context-save.cjs` or `plugins/development-harness/hooks/pre-compact-context-save.cjs`) fires before context window compression. The hook extracts and persists to a durable location: active task ID, recently modified file paths, and a structured snapshot. A `SessionStart` hook (matcher: `compact`) reads the snapshot and injects it as `additionalContext`.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAll conditions resolved:\\n\\n| Condition | Status | Evidence |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `PreCompact` event exists | AVAILABLE | `hooks-core-reference/SKILL.md` line 35 |\\n| Payload fields at compression time | AVAILABLE | `hooks-io-api/SKILL.md` lines 161\u2013174 |\\n| Assistant message content in payload | AVAILABLE (absent) | Not in payload; requires JSONL read of `transcript_path` |\\n| Exit code behavior | AVAILABLE | Non-blocking; exit 2 = stderr only |\\n| Hook language | AVAILABLE | CJS (`.cjs`) per language-conventions.md |\\n| Session log path convention | DERIVABLE | Depends on #317 and #775 path agreement |\\n</div>\\n\\n## Issue Classification\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**Type**: feature \u2014 new hook and SessionStart recovery entry  \\n**Design dependency**: session log path/format must be agreed with #317 and #775 before writing the snapshot path into this hook\\n</div>\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**New:**\\n- `plugins/development-harness/hooks/pre-compact-context-save.cjs`\\n\\n**Must change:**\\n- `plugins/development-harness/hooks/hooks.json` \u2014 add `PreCompact` entry (both matchers); add `SessionStart` recovery entry\\n\\n**Reference (read-only during implementation):**\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/hooks-core-reference/SKILL.md` \u2014 PreCompact event schema\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/hooks-io-api/SKILL.md` \u2014 PreCompact payload fields\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/hooks-guide/references/claude-session-log-schema-reference.md` \u2014 load before any JSONL read\\n- `research/context-management/mempalace.md` \u2014 MemPalace hook pattern reference\\n</div>\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Session log path/format: agree with #317 and #775 before writing snapshot path into this hook\\n- Related: #1678 (periodic periodic-save hook \u2014 complements this; PreCompact fires only at compression, #1678 fires every N tool calls throughout session)\\n</div>\\n\\n## Benefits\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Session context survives compaction \u2014 active task, modified files, and working hypothesis available at next `SessionStart`\\n- Eliminates \\\"what was I doing?\\\" disruption after auto-compact interrupts multi-phase builds\\n- Complements `task_status_hook.py` LastActivity tracking with richer snapshot\\n- `SessionStart` recovery injects snapshot as `additionalContext` \u2014 no agent action needed\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] `PreCompact` registered in `hooks.json` with both `manual` and `auto` matchers\\n- [ ] Hook reads active task from `~/.dh/projects/{slug}/context/active-task-{session_id}.json`\\n- [ ] Snapshot contains: ISO timestamp, `trigger`, `session_id`, active task ID (if available), recently modified file paths from JSONL\\n- [ ] Hook exits 0 on success; never exits 2 (`PreCompact` is non-blockable)\\n- [ ] `SessionStart` hook (matcher: `compact`) reads snapshot and injects it as `additionalContext`\\n- [ ] Snapshot path is consistent with convention adopted by #317 and #775\\n- [ ] Manual test: trigger `/compact` mid-task; snapshot file exists at expected path with expected fields\\n- [ ] Load `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/hooks-guide/references/claude-session-log-schema-reference.md` before implementing any JSONL transcript reads\\n</div>\\n\\n## Effort\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**STANDARD** \u2014 one new CJS hook script (~80\u2013100 lines), one `hooks.json` PreCompact entry, one `SessionStart` recovery entry. Complexity is in JSONL extraction logic, not in hook wiring.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code for multi-phase tasks**, I want **a `PreCompact` hook that saves active task state, modified files, and decisions before context compression** so that **the post-compaction session can resume with full awareness of what was in progress**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Research entry: `./research/context-management/mempalace.md` \u2014 pattern: PreCompact Hook (Section 7: Auto-Save Hooks)\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-04-08\\n- **Groomed**: 2026-04-09\\n</div>\\n\\n## Research Resolution\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**Does Claude Code expose a `PreCompact` hook event?**\\nYes \u2014 confirmed in `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/hooks-core-reference/SKILL.md` line 35. `PreCompact` is a documented first-class event with two matchers: `manual` (fires on `/compact`) and `auto` (fires on auto-compact when context window is full).\\n\\n**What data is available to a hook at compression time?**\\nConfirmed in `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/hooks-io-api/SKILL.md` lines 161\u2013174. Payload fields: `session_id`, `transcript_path` (path to live session JSONL), `cwd`, `permission_mode`, `hook_event_name`, `trigger` (`\\\"manual\\\"` or `\\\"auto\\\"`), `custom_instructions`. **Assistant message content is NOT in the payload.** The hook must read `transcript_path` JSONL to extract decisions or reasoning. Exit code 2 shows stderr to user only \u2014 it cannot cancel compaction.\\n\\n**MemPalace pattern:**\\nDocumented in `research/context-management/mempalace.md` lines 183\u2013191. PreCompact fires before compression, triggers structured save of topics, decisions, quotes, and code changes, then regenerates L1 critical facts. The pattern for this repo: write a snapshot to a durable file without the MemPalace dependency.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"083bdfcea478dac6c25be2746f6427dfd75fd3b1ee0f17cc0ee0d78b1b87fb3c\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABSdrkLw\"}"}